{"v":4,"catch":"打敗邪惡化身ZOUNA，恢復和平！","desc":"\" VS. THE ADVENTURE OF VALKYRIE : The Legend of the Key of Time \"是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於 1986 年發行的 RPG 遊戲。\n使用“THE KEY OF TIME”擊敗MARVEL LAND的統治者ZOUNA，恢復和平。\nVALKYRIE可以透過擊敗敵人來獲得經驗並在旅館升級。\n收集各個地點的物品，打敗在城堡裡等你的ZOUNA。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-07-25","genres":["角色扮演","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e227634512185084afc0e9838950c52e68bef301484fa2a0159c71db3967b274.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4c7b1670c8adf64fd0845048a4655d04a5f14336b7b8ead4d51b658365d768c9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/447ad8d3e23fbeb238545205ae5108ee942cc077679292c098efb3b357d5f85d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/43337be796b4e2338b85fcb22419c1b19884dc967a14ace7e39565d6061242c6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b91a8a0458d6284b060ea64f92184701e87e6c69740ec1c32b305082d2f9ed3e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6aa8c3c78a9198715aa4b14dfbba1237531a26ad8da75d5149a209fd2c9de94c.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d5b01f626000","dlc":[]}